Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.77,0:00:06.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's perfectly fine to get too into something or to laugh like an idiot.}Está perfectamente bien involucrarse\N mucho en algo o reírse como un idiota.{probablemente me falte contexto para entender esta línea ya que no estoy viendo este anime}{<- wut}{pero así quedó en el 11}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.81,0:00:10.74,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{And if anyone says otherwise, I'll beat them up!}¡Y si alguien dice lo contrario, le daré una paliza!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.20,0:00:17.20,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Oh... she's right...}Ah... ella tiene razón...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.28,0:00:19.29,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{All I wanted...}Todo lo que quería...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.79,0:00:24.75,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{...was to be able to live and laugh freely.}era ser capaz de vivir y reír libremente.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.38,0:00:28.25,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Someone to tell me it was okay...}Alguien que me diga que está bien...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.92,0:00:31.51,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{...to have meaning in my life.}tener un significado en mi vida.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.69,0:02:18.91,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{This is the first time I've seen Kou so vulnerable.}Esta es la primera vez que veo a Kou tan vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.41,0:02:26.41,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{He's counting on me to support him.}Está contando conmigo para apoyarlo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.17,0:02:33.84,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{He's pretty cute when he's like this.}Es muy lindo cuando está así.{otonashikute ergo kawaii}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.76,0:02:37.80,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{This is my favorite scent.}Este es mi aroma favorito.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.84,0:02:40.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{}Kou...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.84,0:02:42.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Not yet.}Espera.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.27,0:02:48.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Don't let go.}No te alejes.{alejes ewe}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.52,0:02:54.65,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Huh? Why?}¿Eh? ¿Por qué?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.36,0:03:04.45,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Oh... he doesn't want me to see him cry.}Entiendo... No quiere que lo vea llorar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.70,0:03:09.91,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{That must've been why he put his arms around me in the first place.}Quizá por eso puso sus brazos sobre mí antes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.42,0:03:13.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sorry, I'm fine now.}Lo siento, estoy bien ahora.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.25,0:03:16.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Okay.}Bueno.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.68,0:03:28.35,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Oh no.}Ay, no.{Qué mal\ Rayos}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.18,0:03:34.81,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Half of me wants to support him in any way I can,}Una parte de mí quiere apoyarlo en todo lo que pueda,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.81,0:03:41.36,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{but the other half just wants\N to look at his tear-stained face.}pero la otra solo quiere ver su\N rostro con rastros de lágrimas.{masoquista}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.61,0:03:45.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey, you know...}Oye, sabías que...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.20,0:03:48.29,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You make one heck of a face when you run.}haces unos gestos tan raros cuando corres.{I sort of feel like this is metaphorical running though}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.29,0:03:52.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You're so mean! How could you make fun of me when I was so desperately...}¡Qué malo eres! ¿Cómo puedes burlarte de mí cuando desesperadamente yo...?{intentaba venir en tu auxilio? Qcio, estoy completando la frase}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.25,0:03:57.00,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm not making fun of you.}No me estoy burlando de ti.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.09,0:04:02.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You were actually kind of cool.}De hecho, te veías muy bien.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.14,0:04:05.80,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{By the light of the moon,}{Gracias a}{Plz, moar romanticism, ok?}Bajo la luz de la luna,{partially chosen because I feel more comfortable when there's a comma, and partially chosen because au clair de la lune}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.80,0:04:09.68,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Kou's eyelashes glimmered.}las pestañas de Kou destellaron.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.60,0:04:14.19,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{His face had been stained with tears.}Su cara ha sido manchada por lágrimas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.02,0:04:16.94,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I must be the only one}Debo ser la única persona
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.07,0:04:20.15,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{to have ever seen him like this.}que lo ha visto en tal estado.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.74,0:04:22.74,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{The only one he'd show this to.}La única a quien se mostraría así.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.62,0:04:31.58,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Wait... isn't this the perfect time to confess?}Espera... ¿No es el momento perfecto para confesarme?{also consider "perfect time to tell him my feelings?"}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.34,0:05:23.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{}Kou—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.89,0:05:34.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Let's grab a bite and go home.}Vayamos a comer algo y volvamos a casa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.02,0:05:40.23,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Just like a couple! I feel bad for Yuuri, but I can't let this slip!}¡Justo como una pareja! ¡Me siento mal por Yuuri, \Npero no puedo dejar pasar esta oportunidad!{the foodgetting is couplelike; they're not couplelike yet}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.98,0:05:43.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh, we can't.}Ah, no podemos.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.53,0:05:50.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I stopped by your house before I came, and Tanaka-sensei was there.}Fui a tu casa antes de venir y Tanaka-sensei estaba ahí.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.24,0:05:55.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{He probably made dinner and is waiting for you.}Probablemente te haya hecho la cena y te esté esperando.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.17,0:06:04.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Tanaka-sensei said something to me.}Tanaka-sensei me dijo algo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.09,0:06:07.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{He thought you bore a grudge against him.}Piensa que le guardas rencor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.05,0:06:14.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's because he wasn't able to be by your side when you needed him the most.}Ya que no pudo estar a tu lado cuando más lo necesitabas.{I know it doesn't match the previous episode, but this makes more sense}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.97,0:06:20.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Huh? We were living so far apart that it's not like there was anything he could've done.}{este "ah", me suena más como un "¿eh?" en español}¿Eh? Vivíamos muy lejos, \Ny no fue como si él pudiese haber hecho algo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.65,0:06:24.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah.}Sí.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.49,0:06:30.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I think you should tell him that yourself.}Creo que deberías decirle eso.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.54,0:06:44.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Bye.}Adiós.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.50,0:06:46.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Oh, yeah.}Ah, sí.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.01,0:06:47.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Bye.}Adiós.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.97,0:06:53.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{See you tomorrow!}¡Nos vemos mañana!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.97,0:06:57.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, see you at school.}Sí, te veo en la escuela.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.43,0:06:59.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yep, see you!}¡Sí, nos vemos!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.23,0:07:05.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yoshioka!}¡Yoshioka!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.45,0:07:12.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Thanks.}Gracias.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.58,0:07:16.49,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah!}¡De nada!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.55,0:07:32.26,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{It opened.\fad(0,350)}Se abrió.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.55,0:07:36.76,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Kou's door really opened.}La puerta de Kou realmente se abrió.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.60,0:07:40.31,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{You've finally stepped outside, right?}Por fin diste un paso al exterior, ¿eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.19,0:07:44.61,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{But even if you won't come out this time,}Pero, aun si no lo hubieras hecho ahora,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.07,0:07:49.24,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I'll just kick that door down again.}simplemente volvería a golpear esa puerta de nuevo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.90,0:07:54.16,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I'll kick it down any time you need me!}¡Y la derribaré todas las veces que sea necesario!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.09,0:08:11.01,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{You desperately keep running to save me}Sigues desesperadamente tratando de salvarme...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.01,0:08:14.43,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{no matter how many times you fail.}sin importar cuántas veces falles.
