Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.21,0:08:50.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What about dinner?}¿Quieres cenar?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.92,0:08:52.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sure...}Claro...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.10,0:09:07.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey, Dad. Welcome home.}Ah, papá, bienvenido a casa. {hearing oyaji makes me want to use pops}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.52,0:09:09.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Is that you, Youichi?}¿Eres tú, Youichi?
