Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.16,0:09:22.37,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Just a minute, Dad. I'm almost done...}Espera un minuto, papá, ya casi termino...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.79,0:09:29.29,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Man, I'm starving. Guess I'll eat tonight.}Ah... estoy hambriento, supongo que comeré esta noche.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.71,0:09:35.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Great! Kou, can you serve the rice?}¡Estupendo! Kou, ¿puedes servir el arroz?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.64,0:09:40.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Don't forget to get chopsticks for everyone.}No olvides poner palillos para todos.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.89,0:09:41.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sure.}Claro.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.32,0:09:57.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Welcome back.}Bienvenido.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.24,0:10:03.41,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I see.}Ya veo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.00,0:10:13.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Thanks.}Gracias.{}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.05,0:10:23.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{All right, help yourselves.}Bien, sírvanse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.39,0:10:25.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Thanks for the food.}Gracias por la comida.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.02,0:10:27.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Thanks for the food.}Gracias por la comida.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.06,0:10:27.56,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,{Thanks for the food.}Gracias por la comida.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.95,0:10:42.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You know, I've waited so long for this day.}¿Saben?, he estado esperando tanto por este día.
