Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.83,0:10:53.71,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Guess I couldn't keep it up.}Supongo que al final no pude.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.46,0:11:00.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{After Mom died, I didn't know}Después de que mamá falleciera, no sabía...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.68,0:11:03.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{whether coming back to this house alone}si regresar a casa solo...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.60,0:11:06.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{and eating together like this without her}y comer juntos así, sin ella...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.27,0:11:08.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{was really okay.}estaba realmente bien.{Shiki: No sé bien si se puede conectar así los diálogos, entre los puntitos o//o}{sí, al menos yo no le veo problema}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.44,0:11:15.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I didn't know if it was okay to do all the things Mom wasn't able to.}No sabía si estaba bien hacer\N todas las cosas que mamá no podía.{puede}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.57,0:11:17.61,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I never knew...}Nunca supe...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.40,0:11:20.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{}Kou...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.95,0:11:25.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Your mother...}Su madre...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.08,0:11:32.75,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{She wasn't that uncaring a woman.}no era una mujer así de insensible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.37,0:12:11.00,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah. Tonight's dinner is delicious.}Sí. La cena de hoy está deliciosa.
