Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.70,0:12:46.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Changing your name in high school \Ncould cause quite a stir.}Cambiar tu nombre en preparatoria podría causar bastante confusión. {Agitamiento suena demasiado fuerte, así que lo cambié a confusión, igual se mantiene la idea}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.87,0:12:51.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{All right, I understand.}Bueno, entiendo. {changing to match}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.96,0:12:55.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{We can wait until after you sort your feelings.}Podemos esperar hasta que ordenes tus sentimientos.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.33,0:13:02.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Even if our names are different, we'll always be a family.}Incluso si nuestros nombres son diferentes, siempre seremos una familia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.22,0:13:07.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Thanks, Dad.}Gracias, papá.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.23,0:13:19.02,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I guess Kou's not here yet.}Supongo que Kou aún no llega.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.44,0:13:25.28,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I got a little carried away last night and ended up doing some crazy things,}Parece que me dejé llevar un poco anoche y terminé haciendo algunas cosas locas,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.53,0:13:30.99,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{but now that I have a chance to breathe, the embarrassment is catching up.}pero ahora que lo pienso mejor,\N me da algo de vergüenza.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.49,0:13:35.58,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Even if we consider what happened just a friend helping a friend,}Aun si lo veo como si se tratara de un amigo ayudando a otro,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.33,0:13:39.29,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{that doesn't mean it'll be any \Nless awkward to face him today.}eso no significa que será menos incómodo verlo hoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.04,0:13:41.25,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{What about Kou?}¿Y cómo será para Kou?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.17,0:13:45.42,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{How's he going to handle it?}¿Cómo manejará esto?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.10,0:13:53.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{M-Morning...}B-Buenos días...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.81,0:14:01.82,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Looks like he's just as flustered as me.}Parece que está tan nervioso como yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.11,0:14:06.07,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{I guess that makes sense.}Supongo que tiene sentido.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.79,0:14:23.84,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{What did he just do? It was so adorable!}¿Qué acaba de hacer? ¡Fue tan adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.84,0:14:26.13,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Did Kou always act like that?}¿Siempre actuó así?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.05,0:14:29.18,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Crap, I can't keep a straight face.}Rayos, no puedo mantener la seriedad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.68,0:14:33.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Where were you yesterday?!}¡¿Dónde estuviste ayer?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.18,0:14:38.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I can't believe you ditched us.}No puedo creer que nos abandonaras.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.19,0:14:41.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, me neither. Sorry about that.}Sí, yo tampoco, lo siento.{"can't say I disagree" would make sense in response to "the way you ditsched us was so mean"}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.40,0:14:43.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You sure don't sound like you're sorry.}Pues no pareces arrepentido.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.78,0:14:46.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{How about today? Are you free?}¿Qué tal hoy? ¿Están libres?{creo que por la respuesta de futaba más adelante, la pregunta la hace en general a todos}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.70,0:14:50.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What did you just say?}¿Qué acabas de decir?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.78,0:14:54.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'll do as much as I can. How's that sound?}Haré mi mejor esfuerzo, ¿qué dicen?{it doesn't quite come across but he's referring back to Kominato saying he's not sincere}{I think it's gut genug}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.16,0:14:57.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Really? I'm free all day.}¿En serio? Estaré libre todo el día.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.96,0:15:01.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Damn, I'm think I'm gonna cry... just kidding.} {...}{...}Diablos, creo que voy a llorar... Bueno, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.25,0:15:02.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Let's do it!}¡Hagámoslo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.96,0:15:04.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{}Me parece bien.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.05,0:15:05.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Okay.}Bien.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.21,0:15:10.51,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You can count on us to keep \Nthose summer lessons at bay!}¡Puedes contar con nosotros {en \Nmantener las clases de verano a raya}para salvarte de esas clases de verano!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.51,0:15:13.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Leave it all to us!}¡Déjanoslo a nosotros!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.33,0:15:44.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What the heck is this?}¿Qué diablos es esto?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.50,0:15:47.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Just my way of saying thanks.}Simplemente mi manera de decir gracias.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.13,0:15:49.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sorry, I guess.}Lo siento, supongo.{creo}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.38,0:15:54.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You all went out of your way to help me study,\N and I outscored every one of you.}Todos ustedes me ayudaron a estudiar y los superé.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.80,0:15:58.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You're pretty spiteful, aren't you?}Eres algo vengativo, ¿no?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.35,0:16:01.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Man, I was} {\i1}{not}{\i0} {expecting this.}Ah... Me sorprende bastante.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.85,0:16:07.65,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm so glad we all got into the top section!\N\NIt's my first time ever!}¡Me alegra que todos estemos en el cuadro de honor! \N¡Es mi primera vez{ s-senpai}! {I don't think it's common knowledge that being posted = good, and I'm sure other anime have everyone's names up}{Yeah, some schools post all the grades}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.65,0:16:09.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{We didn't put in all that effort for nothing.}No nos esforzamos por nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.94,0:16:11.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You're right.}Tienes razón.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.82,0:16:17.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You can say that again. Now we can focus on making vacation plans.}Ya lo creo. Ahora podemos enfocarnos en hacer nuestros planes vacacionales.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.12,0:16:21.29,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{That's right! Nothing but good times ahead of us!}¡Cierto! ¡No nos espera otra cosa, más que divertirnos! {creo que "Diversión" suena mejor que "Buenos tiempos", ya que el último suena más como un recuerdo, no sé si me explico}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.58,0:16:23.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I always get shaky knees up here.}En momentos así, me tiemblan las rodillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.58,0:16:27.00,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You're right there, Touma.}Ahí estás, Tou{MAN}ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.00,0:16:28.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Huh, seriously?}¿Eh? ¿En serio?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.63,0:16:30.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Wow, I am!}¡Oh, es cierto!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.67,0:16:34.38,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{It's the guy from the library!}¡Es el chico de la biblioteca!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.64,0:16:38.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{The molester!}¡La acosadora! {literally female pervert}{oh, how many times have I seen it translated as "female pervert"...}{Lu: No sé si en verdad lo dice en voz alta, yo usaría AoHaru ital}{ah}{Ño}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.43,0:16:40.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Wait, Touma?}Espera, ¿Touma?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.52,0:16:43.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey, wasn't he—}Oye, no era el—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.56,0:16:45.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Not a word! I'm ashamed!}¡No digas nada! ¡Qué vergüenza!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.52,0:16:51.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{A-Anyway, let the good times begin! It's summer!}¡E-En fin, que comience la diversión! ¡Estamos en verano!{I might be insane, but I think this exists? if not it should}{"clear skies" as a metaphor for "days without trouble" is a thing, but the way you have it formulated sounds like you've been corrupted by Aikatsu}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.53,0:16:54.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Summer is here!}¡Llegó el verano! {Shiki: Probablemente suene mejor "¡El verano está aquí!" en el inglés, sin embargo, nunca he escuchado a alguien que hable español diga eso}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.95,0:17:04.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I know you're excited for summer vacation, \Nbut don't get yourselves into too much trouble.}Sé que están emocionados por las vacaciones de verano,\N pero no se metan en muchos problemas.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.54,0:17:05.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You're dismissed.}Ya pueden salir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.42,0:17:10.71,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Hey, are you free now?}Oye, ¿estás libre ahora?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.71,0:17:12.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sure, let's hang out somewhere.}Sí, vayamos por ahí.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.46,0:17:14.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{We need to sort out our plans, anyway.}También tenemos que hacer nuestros planes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.80,0:17:15.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Sounds good to me.}Me parece bien.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.97,0:17:17.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Kou, what about...}Kou, ¿qué hay...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.55,0:17:20.51,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Wait, where'd he go?}Espera, ¿adónde se fue?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.51,0:17:23.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I just saw him leaving with his bag.}Acaba de verlo salir con su bolso.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.27,0:17:23.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{He's so quick!}¡Qué rápido!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.73,0:17:27.06,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{And Kominato-kun is...}Y Kominato-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.06,0:17:28.65,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{And the AC was broken!}¡Y el aire acondicionado estaba roto! {ni idea qué sea AC, lo siento, podría significar Arcade o Aire acondicionado según google}{Aire acondicionado, plz, es una de las abreviaturas más comunes en inglés}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.65,0:17:31.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Looks like he's busy.}Parece que está ocupado.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.36,0:17:33.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Alright, then let's go after Kou!}¡Bien, vayamos tras Kou!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.78,0:17:35.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Wait up, Futaba-chan!}¡Espera, Futaba-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.78,0:17:38.32,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{He probably hasn't left the building yet.}Probablemente aún no haya salido de la escuela.{or you could translate it slightly literallier, I guess}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.91,0:17:44.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Shuuko!}¡Shuuko!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.62,0:17:45.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Shuu-chan!}¡Shuu-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.21,0:17:48.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{You two can go get Mabuchi.}Pueden ir a buscar a Mabuchi primero. {Shiki: El "Antes" lo agregué para ser más específica, sería antes de que vayan a hacer sus planes}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.67,0:17:50.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Got it!}¡Bueno!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.42,0:17:52.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{We'll wait for you at the entrance!}¡Te esperaremos en la entrada!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.80,0:18:00.72,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{They sure are lively.}Sí que son animadas.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.51,0:18:04.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Shuuko! Shuu-chan!}¡Shuuko! ¡Shuu-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.98,0:18:10.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{}Futaba-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.94,0:18:13.65,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm gonna get serious this summer!}¡Voy a ir en serio este verano!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.95,0:18:18.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{M-Me too!}¡Y-Yo también!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.24,0:18:21.37,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Okay!}¡Bien!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.91,0:18:27.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{There he is!}¡Ahí está!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.66,0:18:28.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Kou!}¡Kou!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.25,0:18:31.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Gotcha!}¡Te atrapamos!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.96,0:18:33.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{What?}¿Qué?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.84,0:18:40.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I think that's the first time I've heard someone}Creo que es la primera vez que escucho a alguien
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.51,0:18:43.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{call you by your first name.}llamándote por tu nombre.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.68,0:18:45.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I'm glad.}{Me hace feliz.}{He leído esto en varias ocasiones en este mismo script, yo usaría "felicidad" para algo mucho más serio, al fin y al cabo, en casos así, en que uno felicita a alguien por algo, solemos decir que "nos alegra" que todo saliera o le esté yendo bien, no sé si me entienden...}Me alegro por ti.{Ç}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.73,0:18:48.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Just because I found a place to belong}Que haya encontrado un lugar al cual pertenezco,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.15,0:18:53.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{doesn't mean that my feelings have changed.}no significa que mis sentimientos hayan cambiado.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.61,0:19:00.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I bet you thought you were done with having to put up with me.}Apostaría a que creyó que ya\N no tendría que lidiar conmigo.
