Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.81,0:20:16.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's way more fun to decide these things when we're all together!}¡Es más divertido decidir estas cosas cuando estamos juntos!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.98,0:20:19.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Yeah, she's spot on, Kou.}Ella tiene razón, Kou.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.69,0:20:22.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Be a man and come.}Sé un hombre y ven.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.65,0:20:23.95,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Okay?}¿Sí?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.95,0:20:25.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{So, you wanna do this at Nuts Donuts?}Entonces ¿quieren ir a Nuts Donuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.99,0:20:29.70,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,{Guess I'm stuck with them for the long haul.}Creo que estaré atascado con ellos por un largo tiempo. {yeah, I know he says "long-term course confirmed"}{thine is eek fine}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.33,0:20:31.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Kou!}¡Kou!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.83,0:20:33.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{Let's go.}Vamos.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.77,0:20:53.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{At first, I was alone.}Al principio, estaba sola.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.31,0:20:57.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{But...}Pero...{es ist zu kurz fuer vier woerter}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.28,0:21:03.82,AoHaru,,0,0,5,,{I wanted to change.}quise cambiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.07,0:21:06.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I decided to change.}Decidí cambiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.72,0:21:27.59,AoHaru,,700,0,0,,{And now, I think I've done it.}{\q2}Y ahora... creo que lo logré.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.18,0:21:33.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{I did it by sharing this time with my friends.}Lo hice compartiendo tiempo con mis amigos.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.40,0:22:24.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,{It's still too early to reminisce.}Aún es muy pronto para comenzar a rememorar. {originally had "look back and reminisce}{glad you changed it}
